OL,11,G0350 Witness History
OL,12,     FIn 2007, an abandoned photo album
OL,13,     Frevealed the chilling normality of
OL,14,     Flife at the Nazi concentration
OL,15,     Fcamp, Auschwitz. Among those
OL,16,     Fpictured is Josef Mengele, the
OL,17,     FAngel of Death.
